://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov","html_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":1915,"digest":"sha256:415b4faec3f4afa1a8f42a994ea970eb9c3c51bcaefa296c39101e4d5e73a889","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-22T19:26:54Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T19:26:54Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/download/v0.83.0/verification.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/tarball/v0.83.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/zipball/v0.83.0","body":"## RevealLine v0.83.0 — current Journey by default\n\nOrdinary Start and Missions now open the current Journey: 91 Solo missions,\nthe same 91 Versus missions, and 12 Team missions across five campaigns.\nExplicit Legacy URLs and the visible Legacy controls remain available. Practice,\ncourses, pack launches, Workshop returns and protected departures preserve their\nintended catalogues. The reviewed PR #253/#255 save-warning, Couch Pause and\ninitial-focus corrections are included. Mission definitions, simulation rules,\nprogress migration and database deletion are not part of this release.\n\nSource: `01b189f6427601a15cbb3eb1563b5f82eabbafa3`, tree\n`b547eda9dd8f86db17c9a79093736eefbeeb9dc9`, merged through [PR #263](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/pull/263).\n\nThe actual merged-source [qualification and freeze](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35762623319)\npassed all six source gates and four test shards: 11,788 tests across 901 files,\nwith no failures, cancellations, skips or todos. The separately identified\n[PR run](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35753052831) passed the\nsame game/build/test inputs. Its 237 docs/controller/evidence differences from\nthe merge are fully retained, not relabeled as merged-source test execution.\n\n[Frozen inspection](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35772379842)\nverified every Git source blob/type/mode and source TAR commit, every distribution\nmanifest byte and hash chain, and the offline inventory (900 files / 59,959,274\nbytes). The shipped manifest contains 1,055 files / 590,195,426 bytes.\n\nOriginal distribution: 590,567,603 bytes, SHA-256\n`ee486739cef7bc1dc832c62aaecdfc85e02b0c9957cacdab1d6070a1a1cac451`.\nOriginal source archive: 1,598,607,360 bytes, SHA-256\n`ef8861fb546670eab5770bccec8653934e27d36e73c9202771c9c1e81f58bd3b`.\n\nThe guarded upload and independent receipt review completed with all nine\nrelease assets verified against their reviewed sizes and SHA-256 digests. Pages\nselection, historical-route preservation, public byte verification and affected\nbrowser/prepared-cold-offline journeys remain separate acceptance gates.\nPhysical controllers/touch, full 91-mission balance and musical/listening\nacceptance are not claimed. Journey original pictures still require explicit\nonline preparation outside the complete downloaded distribution. PR #268 and\nother queued features are not included.\n"}